// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_int_int, hol_prod_setprod)
Theorem INT_GCD_COPRIME_DIVIDES_RMUL : forall a b c :e int, gcd_int b c = 1 /\ divides_int b a -> gcd_int a (b * c) = abs_SNo b * gcd_int a c.
Admitted.

